# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik ke masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To demonstrate this method, we start by constructing a simple Clifford "
"circuit. Our goal is to be able to detect when certain types of error occur "
"in this circuit, so that we can discard erroneous measurement results. In "
"error detection terminology, this is also known as our payload circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendemonstrasikan metode ini, kita mulai dengan membangun sirkuit "
"Clifford sederhana. Tujuan kita adalah mampu mendeteksi ketika jenis error "
"tertentu terjadi dalam sirkuit ini, sehingga kita bisa membuang hasil "
"pengukuran yang keliru. Dalam terminologi deteksi error, ini juga dikenal "
"sebagai payload circuit kita.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/f8384a7d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/f8384a7d-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimalkan masalah untuk eksekusi pada hardware kuantum "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our goal is to insert a coherent Pauli check into this payload circuit. But "
"before we do that, we separate this circuit into layers. This will be useful"
" later when inserting Pauli gates in between.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tujuan kita adalah menyisipkan coherent Pauli check ke dalam payload circuit"
" ini. Namun sebelum itu, kita pisahkan sirkuit ini menjadi lapisan-lapisan. "
"Ini akan berguna nanti saat menyisipkan gate Pauli di antaranya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/04bb6ea7-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/04bb6ea7-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we are ready to add coherent Pauli checks into the payload circuit. To "
"do this, we need to construct a \"valid check\" and insert it into the "
"circuit. A \"check\" in this case is an operator that is capable of "
"signaling whether an error occurred in the circuit by making a measurement "
"on an ancilla qubit. It is considered a valid check when the additional "
"operators inserted into the quantum circuit don't logically change the "
"original circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita siap menambahkan coherent Pauli checks ke dalam payload "
"circuit. Untuk melakukan ini, kita perlu membangun \"pemeriksaan yang "
"valid\" dan menyisipkannya ke dalam sirkuit. Sebuah \"pemeriksaan\" dalam "
"hal ini adalah operator yang mampu memberi sinyal apakah error terjadi dalam"
" sirkuit dengan melakukan pengukuran pada qubit ancilla. Pemeriksaan "
"dianggap valid ketika operator tambahan yang disisipkan ke dalam sirkuit "
"kuantum tidak mengubah sirkuit asli secara logis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This check is capable of detecting types of errors that anticommute with it,"
" and the check will trigger a measurement of $\\ket{1}$ state in the ancilla"
" qubit instead of $\\ket{0}$ through phase kickback. Therefore, we will be "
"able to discard measurements where an error was signaled.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ini mampu mendeteksi jenis error yang antikommut dengannya, dan "
"pemeriksaan akan memicu pengukuran state $\\ket{1}$ pada qubit ancilla, "
"bukan $\\ket{0}$, melalui phase kickback. Oleh karena itu, kita akan bisa "
"membuang pengukuran di mana error telah ditandai.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In general, coherent Pauli checks are controlled-Pauli operators inserted "
"into \"wires\" - spacetime locations between gates. The ancilla qubit "
"responsible for signaling the error is the control qubit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara umum, coherent Pauli checks adalah operator Pauli terkendalikan yang "
"disisipkan ke dalam \"wire\" — lokasi spacetime di antara gate. Qubit "
"ancilla yang bertanggung jawab memberi sinyal error adalah qubit kontrol.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below we construct a valid check for the Clifford circuit we created above. "
"We can demonstrate that this check doesn't change the circuit operation by "
"showing that when these Pauli checks are propagated to the front of the "
"circuit, they cancel each other out. This is easily shown because a Pauli "
"operator through a Clifford gate is another Pauli operator.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di bawah ini kita membangun pemeriksaan yang valid untuk sirkuit Clifford "
"yang dibuat di atas. Kita bisa mendemonstrasikan bahwa pemeriksaan ini tidak"
" mengubah operasi sirkuit dengan menunjukkan bahwa ketika Pauli checks ini "
"dipropagasi ke bagian depan sirkuit, mereka saling membatalkan. Ini mudah "
"ditunjukkan karena operator Pauli yang melalui gate Clifford adalah operator"
" Pauli lainnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In general, one can use a decoding heuristic as outlined in "
"[[1]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.15725) to identify valid checks. For the "
"purposes of our initial example, we can also construct valid checks by using"
" analytical Pauli and Clifford gate multiplication conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara umum, seseorang dapat menggunakan heuristik decoding seperti yang "
"diuraikan dalam [[1]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.15725) untuk "
"mengidentifikasi pemeriksaan yang valid. Untuk keperluan contoh awal kita, "
"kita juga dapat membangun pemeriksaan valid menggunakan kondisi perkalian "
"gate Pauli dan Clifford secara analitik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/e1c1e16d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/e1c1e16d-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/246a42b8-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/246a42b8-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we can see, we have a valid check, since the inserted Pauli operators "
"simply have the same effect as an identity operator on the circuit. We can "
"now insert these checks into the circuit with an ancilla qubit. This ancilla"
" qubit, or the check qubit, starts in the $\\ket{+}$ state. It includes the "
"controlled versions of the Pauli operations outlined above and is finally "
"measured in the $X$ basis. This check qubit is now capable of capturing "
"errors in the payload circuit without logically altering it. This is because"
" certain types of noise in the payload circuit will modify the state of the "
"check qubit, and it will be measured \"1\" instead of \"0\" in case such an "
"error occurs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang bisa kita lihat, kita memiliki pemeriksaan yang valid, karena "
"operator Pauli yang disisipkan hanya memiliki efek yang sama dengan operator"
" identitas pada sirkuit. Kita sekarang bisa menyisipkan pemeriksaan-"
"pemeriksaan ini ke dalam sirkuit dengan qubit ancilla. Qubit ancilla ini, "
"atau qubit pemeriksaan, dimulai dalam state $\\ket{+}$. Ia mencakup versi "
"terkendalikan dari operasi Pauli yang diuraikan di atas dan akhirnya diukur "
"dalam basis $X$. Qubit pemeriksaan ini kini mampu menangkap error dalam "
"payload circuit tanpa mengubahnya secara logis. Ini karena jenis noise "
"tertentu dalam payload circuit akan mengubah state qubit pemeriksaan, dan "
"akan diukur \"1\" alih-alih \"0\" jika error semacam itu terjadi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/52add690-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/52add690-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Eksekusi menggunakan Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-"
"qiskit-primitives}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the check qubit is measured in \"0\", we keep that measurement. If it's "
"measured in \"1\", then this means that an error occurred in the payload "
"circuit, and we discard that measurement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika qubit pemeriksaan diukur sebagai \"0\", kita menyimpan pengukuran "
"tersebut. Jika diukur sebagai \"1\", berarti error telah terjadi dalam "
"payload circuit, dan kita membuang pengukuran itu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that with an ideal simulator, the check qubit won't detect any errors "
"as we will show in the subsequent post-processing section. We now introduce "
"a noise model to the simulation and see how the check qubit captures "
"errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa dengan simulator ideal, qubit pemeriksaan tidak akan "
"mendeteksi error apa pun seperti yang akan kita tunjukkan di bagian post-"
"processing berikutnya. Kita sekarang memperkenalkan model noise ke simulasi "
"dan melihat bagaimana qubit pemeriksaan menangkap error.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format "
"{#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 4: Post-process dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang "
"diinginkan {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-"
"format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now retrieve and analyze the results from the Sampler job. We start "
"by plotting results from the noiseless simulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang bisa mengambil dan menganalisis hasil dari job Sampler. Kita "
"mulai dengan memplot hasil dari simulasi tanpa noise.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/4741910b-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/4741910b-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As expected, the check qubit doesn't detect any errors. Next, we plot "
"results from the noisy simulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang diharapkan, qubit pemeriksaan tidak mendeteksi error apa pun. "
"Selanjutnya, kita memplot hasil dari simulasi dengan noise.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/51a8f3d9-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/51a8f3d9-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we can see, some measurements captured the error by flagging the check qubit as \"1\", which are visible in the last four columns. These shots are discarded.\n"
"Note: The ancilla qubit can also introduce new errors to the circuit. To reduce the effect of this, we can insert nested checks with additional ancilla qubits to the quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang bisa kita lihat, beberapa pengukuran menangkap error dengan "
"menandai qubit pemeriksaan sebagai \"1\", yang terlihat pada empat kolom "
"terakhir. Shot-shot ini dibuang.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
