msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh hardware skala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem-1}"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we demonstrate a significant task for quantum computing algorithms, "
"which is preparing a GHZ state. We will demonstrate how to do this on a real"
" backend using error detection.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita mendemonstrasikan tugas penting untuk algoritme komputasi "
"kuantum, yaitu mempersiapkan state GHZ. Kita akan mendemonstrasikan cara "
"melakukan ini pada Backend nyata menggunakan deteksi error.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The error detection algorithm for GHZ state preparation respects the "
"hardware topology. We begin by selecting the desired hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritme deteksi error untuk persiapan state GHZ menghormati topologi "
"hardware. Kita mulai dengan memilih hardware yang diinginkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A GHZ state on $n$ qubits is defined as\n"
"$$\\lvert \\mathrm{GHZ}_n\\rangle \\;=\\; \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(\\lvert 0\\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\,+\\, \\lvert 1\\rangle^{\\otimes n}\\Big).$$\n"
msgstr ""
"State GHZ pada $n$ qubit didefinisikan sebagai\n"
"$$\\lvert \\mathrm{GHZ}_n\\rangle \\;=\\; \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(\\lvert 0\\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\,+\\, \\lvert 1\\rangle^{\\otimes n}\\Big).$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A very naive approach to prepare the GHZ state would be to choose a root "
"qubit with an initial Hadamard gate, which puts the qubit to an equal "
"superposition state, and then to entangle this qubit with every other qubit."
" This is not a good approach, since it requires long-range and deep CNOT "
"interactions. In this tutorial, we will use multiple techniques alongside "
"error detection to reliably prepare the GHZ state on real hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan yang sangat naif untuk mempersiapkan state GHZ adalah memilih "
"qubit root dengan gate Hadamard awal, yang menempatkan qubit ke state "
"superposisi yang setara, lalu mengentangle qubit ini dengan setiap qubit "
"lainnya. Ini bukan pendekatan yang baik, karena memerlukan interaksi CNOT "
"jangkauan panjang dan dalam. Dalam tutorial ini, kita akan menggunakan "
"beberapa teknik bersama deteksi error untuk mempersiapkan state GHZ secara "
"andal pada hardware nyata.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution-1}"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map the GHZ state to hardware {#map-the-ghz-state-to-hardware}"
msgstr "Petakan state GHZ ke hardware {#map-the-ghz-state-to-hardware}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we search for a root to map the GHZ circuit on hardware. We remove "
"edges/nodes whose CZ errors, measurement errors, and $T_2$ values are worse "
"than the thresholds below. These will not be included in the GHZ circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita mencari root untuk memetakan Circuit GHZ pada hardware. Kita "
"menghapus edge/node yang error CZ-nya, error pengukurannya, dan nilai "
"$T_2$-nya lebih buruk dari ambang batas di bawah ini. Ini tidak akan "
"disertakan dalam Circuit GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using the function below, we construct the GHZ circuit on the chosen "
"hardware starting from the root and using breadth-first search (BFS).\n"
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan fungsi di bawah ini, kita membangun Circuit GHZ pada hardware "
"yang dipilih mulai dari root dan menggunakan breadth-first search (BFS).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now repeatedly search for the best root, where the GHZ circuit will "
"originate from.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang berulang kali mencari root terbaik, tempat Circuit GHZ akan "
"berasal.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now construct the GHZ circuit starting from a specific node - as in, the "
"best root - searching for the shortest depth using breadth-first search.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang membangun Circuit GHZ mulai dari node tertentu — yaitu root "
"terbaik — mencari kedalaman terpendek menggunakan breadth-first search.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We need one final consideration before inserting valid checks. This is "
"related to the concept of \"coverage\", which is a measure of how many of "
"the wires in a quantum circuit a check can cover. With a higher coverage, we"
" can detect errors on a wider part of the circuit. With this measure, we can"
" select among the valid checks with the highest circuit coverage. In other "
"words, we will be using the `weighted_coverage` function to score different "
"checks for the GHZ circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita perlu satu pertimbangan terakhir sebelum menyisipkan pemeriksaan yang "
"valid. Ini berkaitan dengan konsep \"coverage\", yang merupakan ukuran "
"berapa banyak wire dalam sirkuit kuantum yang bisa dicakup oleh sebuah "
"pemeriksaan. Dengan coverage yang lebih tinggi, kita bisa mendeteksi error "
"pada bagian sirkuit yang lebih luas. Dengan ukuran ini, kita bisa memilih di"
" antara pemeriksaan valid yang memiliki coverage sirkuit tertinggi. Dengan "
"kata lain, kita akan menggunakan fungsi `weighted_coverage` untuk menilai "
"berbagai pemeriksaan untuk Circuit GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now insert checks to the GHZ circuit. Finding valid checks is very "
"convenient for the GHZ state, since any two-qubit Pauli $Z$ operator $Z_i "
"Z_j$ acting on any two qubits $i,j$ of the GHZ circuit is a support and "
"therefore a valid check.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang bisa menyisipkan pemeriksaan ke Circuit GHZ. Menemukan "
"pemeriksaan yang valid sangat mudah untuk state GHZ, karena setiap operator "
"Pauli $Z$ dua-qubit $Z_i Z_j$ yang bekerja pada dua qubit mana pun $i,j$ "
"dari Circuit GHZ adalah support dan oleh karena itu merupakan pemeriksaan "
"yang valid.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Also note that the checks in this case are controlled-$Z$ operators "
"neighboring Hadamard gates from the left and right on the ancilla qubit. "
"This is equivalent to a CNOT gate applied to the ancilla qubit. The code "
"below inserts the checks into the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu dicatat juga bahwa pemeriksaan dalam kasus ini adalah operator $Z$ "
"terkendalikan yang bersebelahan dengan gate Hadamard dari kiri dan kanan "
"pada qubit ancilla. Ini setara dengan gate CNOT yang diterapkan pada qubit "
"ancilla. Kode di bawah ini menyisipkan pemeriksaan ke dalam sirkuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now print out the qubits used in the GHZ circuit and the check "
"qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang bisa mencetak qubit yang digunakan dalam Circuit GHZ dan qubit"
" pemeriksaan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can also print out some error statistics.\n"
msgstr "Kita juga bisa mencetak beberapa statistik error.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As previously, we can simulate the circuit first in the absence of noise to "
"ensure correctness of the GHZ state preparation circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti sebelumnya, kita bisa mensimulasikan sirkuit terlebih dahulu tanpa "
"noise untuk memastikan kebenaran Circuit persiapan state GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/b905e875-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/b905e875-1.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As expected, the check qubits are measured as all zeros, and we successfully"
" prepared the GHZ state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang diharapkan, qubit pemeriksaan diukur semuanya sebagai nol, dan "
"kita berhasil mempersiapkan state GHZ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives-1}"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we are ready to run the circuit on real hardware and demonstrate how the"
" error detection protocol can capture errors in GHZ state preparation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita siap menjalankan Circuit di hardware nyata dan "
"mendemonstrasikan bagaimana protokol deteksi error dapat menangkap kesalahan"
" dalam persiapan state GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We define a helper function to add measurements to the GHZ circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mendefinisikan fungsi bantu untuk menambahkan pengukuran ke GHZ "
"Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before execution, we draw the layout of the GHZ qubits and the check qubits "
"on the selected hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum eksekusi, kita menggambar tata letak GHZ qubit dan check qubit pada "
"hardware yang dipilih.\n"

