# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the histogram above, we plotted 20 bitstring measurements from the GHZ "
"qubits that were not flagged by the check qubits. As expected, all-0 and "
"all-1 bitstrings have the highest counts. Note that some erroneous "
"bitstrings with low error weights were not captured by the error detection. "
"The highest counts are still found in the expected bitstrings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada histogram di atas, kita memplot 20 pengukuran bitstring dari GHZ qubit "
"yang tidak ditandai oleh check qubit. Seperti yang diharapkan, bitstring "
"semua-0 dan semua-1 memiliki jumlah terbanyak. Perlu dicatat bahwa beberapa "
"bitstring yang keliru dengan bobot error rendah tidak tertangkap oleh "
"deteksi error. Jumlah tertinggi masih ditemukan pada bitstring yang "
"diharapkan.\n"

