msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"If you found this work interesting, you might be interested in the following material:\n"
"- To further explore technical details of GHZ state preparation, see [[3]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.09520). In addition to error detection, authors use readout error mitigation with M3 and TREX and perform temporary uncomputation techniques to prepare high-fidelity GHZ states.\n"
"- Tutorial on [repetition codes](/tutorials/repetition-codes).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"Jika kamu merasa karya ini menarik, mungkin kamu tertarik dengan materi berikut:\n"
"- Untuk mengeksplorasi lebih lanjut detail teknis persiapan state GHZ, lihat [[3]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.09520). Selain deteksi error, para penulis menggunakan readout error mitigation dengan M3 dan TREX serta melakukan teknik uncomputation sementara untuk mempersiapkan state GHZ dengan fidelitas tinggi.\n"
"- Tutorial tentang [repetition codes](/tutorials/repetition-codes).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

